ttps://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-26T13:31:52Z","updated_at":"2023-10-26T13:31:52Z","body":"I'd suggest `hdparm` as the ID and `hdparm License` as the name. From a couple of quick searches, the hdparm project appears to be the primary (if not only) place where this particular wording is used, so I think it's reasonable for us to reference it to that license.\r\n\r\n@richardfontana the naming for `0BSD` is an issue that pre-dates my involvement with SPDX, but I believe had a lot of back-story that went into that name and ID as a one-off.\r\n\r\nGiven that \"BSD-style\" is often used in license review / scanning as a catch-all to refer to BSD-like licenses, I would have some hesitancy with picking any one license and saying \"this is the BSD-style license\". And since this one appears to be tied to a single project, I'd suggest we just use the hdparm name for this one.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1781134186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1781234376","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2167#issuecomment-1781234376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2167","id":1781234376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85qK3rI","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-26T14:22:33Z","updated_at":"2023-10-26T14:22:33Z","body":"I like @swinslow 's proposal.  It answers all my objections to the other name.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1781234376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1781424079","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2167#issuecomment-1781424079","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2167","id":1781424079,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85qLl_P","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_ur